diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index 4b3f8ac87..f1c3ff6ce 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -312,7 +312,8 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - New **Media Player** (**shared** between Sevopedia Movies and Music): supports **Replay**, **Eject (Exit)**, **Previous Track** and **Next track**, **Toggle Movies/Music**, **Fast Up** and **Fast Down** (change grouping), **Timer**, and a **Playlist** and a **TV panel** on the right side for **non-bik** files (e.g., for **nif**, **dds**), or **a more compact** queue form **for bik files**. This allows to view without having to exit the screen. Click on **Eject button** or **Right-click** to **stop the media playing**; press Escape or Enter key for main menu. See [Sevopedia reworks (Media Player)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-090-media-player).
 - New **Movies category** (bik, nif, dds) for **Victories**, **Wonders**, **Projects**, **Religions**, (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5511+) **Corporations**, and **Eras**, additional **audio support for non-bik** files (e.g. Religions have a nif + separate audio asset). **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to their entry in Sevopedia Movies. See [Sevopedia reworks (Movies (with audio support))](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-091-movies-category-with-audio-support).
 - New **Music category**: allows to play **~1750 audio scripts** (i.e. files) in Sevopedia, notably for **Techs**, **Leaders**, **Eras**, **Civilizations**, and many other. **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to Sevopedia Music. Approach broadly similar to that of Sevopedia Movies. **Search bar support** and **widening** allows to find desired tracks. Note: there are **multiple sounds in an item** for each civilization sound item, so **replay many times the same item to hear all civilization sounds**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Music)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-092-music-category-1750-audio-scripts-playable-in-sevopedia).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5673+) New **Expanded Text Panels** so History/Background **text** (e.g. of the Viking unit that is long and requires scrolling to be seen or of the Gret General Unit (that includes uniquenames that require scrolling to be scanned quickly)) easier to read, with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. It occupies the whole item's page but preserves footer, header, item bar and category bar for easy browsing. Added as an optional helper shared accross several categories (main code in [_sevopedia_helpers.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/_sevopedia_helpers.py)). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded text panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-093-expanded-text-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5673+) New **Expanded Text Panels** so History/Background **text** (e.g. of the Viking unit that is long and requires scrolling to be seen or of the Gret General Unit (that includes uniquenames that require scrolling to be scanned quickly)) easier to read, with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. It occupies the whole item's page but **preserves the rest of the sevopedia page display** (footer, header, item bar and category bar) for easy browsing. Added as an optional helper shared accross several categories (main code in [_sevopedia_helpers.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/_sevopedia_helpers.py)). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded text panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-093-expanded-text-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5674+) New **Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g. Animation) Panels** similarly so **animations** (e.g. of the Viking unit) can be viewed **maximized** (i.e. using all the item's page), with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g., Animation) Panels)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-094-expanded-content-non-text-eg-animation-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
 - Added a new **Sevopedia Builds** category (e.g. **"Remove Jungle"**, **Chop Down a Forest**, **"Build a Road"**, **"Create a Farm"**) distinct from Sevopedia Improvements, notably with **FeatureStruct** panels and **mod-agnostic new Civilopedia blurbs-based Background panel** (added the new XML field `Civilopedia`> to BuildInfos). Also added them to **Sevopedia Index** as **clickable entries with buttons**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Builds)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-040-builds-category-eg-remove-jungle-build-road-create-a-farm).
 - Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.
 - Sevopedia — Terrain: add new **Peak** add **Hill** entries (they were previously hidden in Base AdvCiv). Even though they technically are plot types, adding them helps show some information specific to these "terrains".

